  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12.0pt;line-height:115%;\r\nfont-family:&amp;quot;Aptos&amp;quot;,sans-serif;mso-ascii-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\nAptos;mso-fareast-theme-font:minor-latin;mso-hansi-theme-font:minor-latin;\r\nmso-bidi-font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;;mso-bidi-theme-font:minor-bidi;\r\nmso-ansi-language:EN-GB;mso-fareast-language:EN-US;mso-bidi-language:AR-SA&quot;&gt;The\r\nproposal including removal of the hedge from the front boundary together with\r\nlaying of new driveway would fail to respect and preserve the character of the\r\ndwellinghouse and the visual amenities of the Pinnerwood Park Conservation Area.\r\nThe proposal will be contrary to the advice within the National Planning Policy\r\nFramework (2024), Policies D3 and HC1 of the London Plan (2021), Core Policy\r\nCS1 (B) of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012) and policy DM 1, DM6 and DM7 of the\r\nHarrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the Pinnerwood\r\nPark Conservation Area Appraisal and Management Strategy (CAAMS).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
